<title>USA: U.S. Treasuries stay lower, eye T-bill auctions.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasuries stay lower, eye T-bill auctions.</headline>
<text>
<p>*U.S. Treasuries retain modest losses in early afternoon</p>
<p>*Mkt awaits bill results. 3-mo seen at 5.11, 6-mo at 5.17 pct</p>
<p>*Some dealers creating shorts ahead of Tuesday's 2-yr sale</p>
<p>*Tuesday's Greenspan testimony said keeping market nervous</p>
<p>*Few willing to take risks, fearing hawkish tone from Greenspan</p>
</text>
